{"3602100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Renovation", "steam_appid": 3602100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/7485235943a4a1118e5bd4e6f58e03b8.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/7485235943a4a1118e5bd4e6f58e03b8.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/7485235943a4a1118e5bd4e6f58e03b8.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Last Renovation</strong></i> is an unusual horror game with a mix of absurdity and humor. The player takes on the role of Hubert, who embarks on a nighttime mission to retrieve stolen tools from his neighbor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  🛠️ <strong>Tool Collection</strong> – Your goal is to recover 16 tools hidden around the house. Each tool makes things more chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/2c4495220503a0c82f64790af87ccf5f.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/2c4495220503a0c82f64790af87ccf5f.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/2c4495220503a0c82f64790af87ccf5f.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Stealth &amp; Evasion</strong> – The neighbor isn’t just standing around! He patrols the house, watches TV, eats toast, and uses the toilet. But if he spots you… the hunt begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/ff7c4d31293ea820fd8b7d830473d741.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/ff7c4d31293ea820fd8b7d830473d741.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/ff7c4d31293ea820fd8b7d830473d741.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Hiding Mechanic</strong> – Sneak into wardrobes, hide under beds, in the shower, or even in the trash can. But beware – some hiding spots aren’t as safe as they seem…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/5d25899bb4e2e30560f409bb7358a027.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/5d25899bb4e2e30560f409bb7358a027.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/5d25899bb4e2e30560f409bb7358a027.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔩 <strong>Interactive Environment</strong> – Pick up and throw objects, open doors, turn lights on and off, use the computer, order pizza, play the radio, start a fan, and more!  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/904c7ea627d846fd3cdc7132207f0756.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/904c7ea627d846fd3cdc7132207f0756.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/904c7ea627d846fd3cdc7132207f0756.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 <strong>Traps &amp; Obstacles</strong> – The more tools you collect, the trickier it gets! Watch out for alarms, security cameras, tripwires, slippery floors, and other surprises.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/c0e4597426e2642a85929b3d0df76006.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/c0e4597426e2642a85929b3d0df76006.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/c0e4597426e2642a85929b3d0df76006.mp4?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😱 <strong>Unexpected Visitors</strong> – It’s not just you and the neighbor. Over time, new characters appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/cd58dfa3bc309f5e0d7e353e983667a9.poster.avif?t=1783623859\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/cd58dfa3bc309f5e0d7e353e983667a9.webm?t=1783623859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a